<title>FRANCE: Ecia 1996 net rises to 364 mln Ffr.</title>
<headline>Ecia 1996 net rises to 364 mln Ffr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attributable			     364  vs	     327</p>
<p>    Net dividend (francs)			 10  vs	     8.5</p>
<p>    Operating					612  vs	     670</p>
<p>    Pre-tax					  612  vs	     570</p>
<p>    Cashflow					 798  vs	     728</p>
<p>    Financial investments			620  vs		15</p>
<p>    Turnover				     9,453  vs	   9,106</p>
<p>    Net financial debt			   196  vs	     104</p>
<p>NOTE - Car parts maker Ecia gave its results in a statement.</p>
</text>
